<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= pageTitle %></title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <header class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Tailscale 내부 전용</p>
        <h1>민수 브리핑</h1>
        <p class="hero-summary">매일 쌓이는 개인 브리핑 게시판. 텔레그램은 입구, 읽기는 여기서.</p>
        <p class="meta">최근 렌더링 · <%= generatedAt %></p>
      </header>

      <section class="board-grid">
        <% if (!briefings.length) { %>
          <article class="card empty-card">
            <h2>아직 브리핑이 없어</h2>
            <p class="muted">generate 스크립트로 오늘 브리핑을 넣으면 여기 쌓여.</p>
          </article>
        <% } %>

        <% briefings.forEach((briefing) => { %>
          <article class="card briefing-card">
            <p class="eyebrow"><%= briefing.briefing_date %></p>
            <h2><%= briefing.title %></h2>
            <p><%= briefing.summary %></p>
            <div class="tag-row">
              <% briefing.tags.forEach((tag) => { %>
                <span class="tag"><%= tag %></span>
              <% }) %>
            </div>
            <a class="primary-link" href="/<%= briefing.html_path.replace(/^\/+/, '') %>">브리핑 보기 →</a>
          </article>
        <% }) %>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
